		{"id":"47c5d5f023bf2199","type":"text","text":"```bash\n╔══════════╣ Searching passwords in config PHP files (T1552.001)\n/etc/wordpress/config-wp.gitroot.vuln.php:   define('DB_PASSWORD', ' ');                                                                                                                                                           \n/etc/wordpress/config-wp.gitroot.vuln.php:   define('DB_USER', 'wordpress');\n/usr/share/wordpress/wp-admin/setup-config.php: $pwd = trim( wp_unslash( $_POST[ 'pwd' ] ) );\n/usr/share/wordpress/wp-admin/setup-config.php: define('DB_PASSWORD', $pwd);\n/usr/share/wordpress/wp-admin/setup-config.php: define('DB_USER', $uname);\n/usr/share/wordpress/wp-config.php:    define('DB_USER', 'wordpress');\n/usr/share/wordpress/wp-config-sample.php:define('DB_PASSWORD', 'password_here');\n/usr/share/wordpress/wp-config-sample.php:define('DB_USER', 'username_here');\n\n```","x":13955,"y":10131,"width":587,"height":280},
		{"id":"165c942574c5e123","type":"text","text":"```bash\n┌──(kali㉿kali)-[~/gitroot]\n└─$ git log -p\ncommit a4e7f0852ebe819f3aba9419198a74990b6992c0 (HEAD -> master)\nAuthor: root <pablo@gitroot.vuln>\nDate:   Mon May 25 22:38:23 2020 -0400\n\n    added some important stuff\n\ndiff --git a/33513a92c025212dd3ab564ca8682e2675f2f99bba5a7f521453d1deae7902aa.txt b/33513a92c025212dd3ab564ca8682e2675f2f99bba5a7f521453d1deae7902aa.txt\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..20e3588\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/33513a92c025212dd3ab564ca8682e2675f2f99bba5a7f521453d1deae7902aa.txt\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+pablo_S3cret_P@ss\n+beth_S3cret_P@ss\n+jen_S3cret_P@ss\n\ncommit e4e93b41309b7f2d7adab20bcff048a93f7444c0\nAuthor: root <pablo@gitroot.vuln>\nDate:   Mon May 25 21:34:45 2020 -0400\n\n    I need help\n\ndiff --git a/pablo_HELP.txt b/pablo_HELP.txt\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..4b2a502\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/pablo_HELP.txt\n@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+I need help, something is wrong with this git repo\n\ncommit ce3843e497dd28f992250d36ee1b4e8c9e0f18e9\nAuthor: root <pablo@gitroot.vuln>\nDate:   Mon May 25 21:34:34 2020 -0400\n\n    added stats\n\ndiff --git a/set.php b/set.php\nindex a017833..50c6668 100644\n--- a/set.php\n+++ b/set.php\n@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@ if (isset($_GET[\"key\"]) && isset($_GET[\"value\"]) ){\n        $value = $_GET[\"value\"];\n        $gitmem = new Memcached();\n        $gitmem->setOption(Memcached::OPT_BINARY_PROTOCOL, true);\n-       $gitmem->setSaslAuthData(\"pablo@gitroot\", \"ihjedpvqfe\");\n+       $gitmem->setSaslAuthData(\"USERNAME\", \"PASSWORD\");\n        $gitmem->addServer(\"127.0.0.1\", 11211);\n        $response = $gitmem->set($key, $value);\n        if ($response) {\n\n```","x":14414,"y":5490,"width":780,"height":460},
		{"id":"0e2010ca6caa83f0","x":7773,"y":4602,"width":580,"height":220,"type":"text","text":"# git hooks abuse\n- git hooks directory contain scripts to execute like : post-commit, pre-commit etc\n- we created .git/hooks/post-commit with revshell code\n- make zip and put in `/home/jen/public/repos`\n- user jen will extract and will run hooks script `post-commit`"},
